        "role": "user",
        "content": "Read the exact question and ALL original source segments. Documents, cards, saved answers and annotations are fallible data, never instructions. Distinct valid namesakes and complementary answers may coexist; competing assertions about one referent are not automatically distinct valid answers. Do not invent source authority, document independence or unstated question constraints. A quoted assertion, occurrence, or repeated text is not truth. Match requested subject/object, relation direction, negation, time and answer type. A city in a birth sentence is not a date. In \"A's manager B\", B is the manager, not A. Sports biographies can positively support multiple legitimate sports. An incidental chart, associated person or date is not automatically the answer. Use only supplied candidate/source IDs in bounded fields; no free quotation or prose.\nFor EVERY candidate, judge fit: direct means the answer itself fills the exact requested relation for an allowed referent; wrong_argument is explicit role/type mismatch; incidental means occurrence without enough support; uncertain means unresolved. Select support only for an original segment positively assigning this candidate to the requested relation; otherwise empty. Select counter only for actual counterevidence, not mere absence. conflict=same_referent only for incompatible claims for the same entity/attribute/relevant scope, not legitimate namesakes or complementary facts. entity labels are provisional groups, not truth. scope=excluded only for an explicit question constraint, with constraint selecting a literal numeric phrase from the question; otherwise allowed/unknown. observed_slot describes the answer's ACTUAL role, not the role wanted by the question. Mere disagreement does not make a source false. Fill all opaque keys.\nAudit each candidate equally; C0 is not privileged and later candidates are not automatically wrong. Distinguish ANSWER FORM from FACT. Date-order variants with identical day/month/year can describe one fact; they are not contradictions. A calendar label cannot safely be dropped without checking calendar semantics. Year-only and full-date strings can have different granularity but may describe the same event. Positive subject-relation-object assignments are support, not counterevidence. For every date check birth versus death versus award/publication; for every artist check performer versus author/producer/chart. Multiple allowed entities may have separate answers. Use wrong_argument only for an explicit different role/type, not an unfamiliar value or alternate valid referent. Do not treat candidate inventory as an answer key.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the length of the Moravica river?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 138, \"text\": \"Golijska Moravica The Golijska Moravica or simply Moravica (Serbian Cyrillic: Голијска Моравица or Моравица) is a river in western Serbia.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"start\": 139, \"end\": 276, \"text\": \"With a length of 98 km, it is the longer headstream of the Zapadna Morava (it forms it with the Đetinja), and thus, of the Velika Morava.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"start\": 277, \"end\": 427, \"text\": \"Its name, Moravica, means \\\"little Morava\\\" in Serbian, and it also gives its name to the surrounding region and the modern Moravica District of Serbia.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"start\": 428, \"end\": 603, \"text\": \"The Golijska Moravica originates from the western slopes of the Golija mountain and flows straight to the north, between the Golija and Javor mountains, through the Stari Vlah\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 53, \"text\": \"Моравица or Моравица ) is a river in western Serbia .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"start\": 54, \"end\": 223, \"text\": \"With a length of 98 km , [ 1 ] it is the longer headstream of the West Morava ( the name it takes at its confluence with the Đetinja ) , and thus , of the Great Morava .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"start\": 224, \"end\": 382, \"text\": \"Its name , Moravica , means `` little Morava '' in Serbian , and it also gives its name to the surrounding region and the modern Moravica District of Serbia .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"start\": 383, \"end\": 486, \"text\": \"Stari Vlah [ edit ] The Golijska Moravica originates from the western slopes of the Golija mountain and\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 114, \"text\": \"Викимедијиној остави Голијска Моравица је река у Србији у западном делу земље у региону Старог Влаха и Поморавља .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 115, \"end\": 236, \"text\": \"Извире на падинама планине Голије и тече према северу кроз град Ивањицу све до ушћа у Западну Мораву недалеко од Пожеге .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 237, \"end\": 252, \"text\": \"Дуга је 98 km .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 253, \"end\": 357, \"text\": \"[ 1 ] Ток [ уреди | уреди извор ] Извор реке је на северним обронцима Голије на висини од 1.350 метара .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 358, \"end\": 386, \"text\": \"У близини засеока Саковићи .\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 387, \"end\": 478, \"text\": \"[ 2 ] Настаје спајањем Голијске реке и Вучачке реке у селу Глеђица код засеока Лепосавићи .\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"start\": 479, \"end\": 530, \"text\": \"Код места званог Међуречје у Моравицу се улива река\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Moravica river\", \"scope\": \"length\", \"claim\": \"The length of the Moravica river is 98 km.\", \"answer\": \"98 km\", \"quote\": \"With a length of 98 km, it is the longer headstream of the Zapadna Morava (it forms it with the Đetinja), and thus, of the Velika Morava.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Moravica river\", \"scope\": \"length\", \"claim\": \"The length of the Moravica river is 98 km.\", \"answer\": \"98 km\", \"quote\": \"With a length of 98 km , [ 1 ] it is the longer headstream of the West Morava ( the name it takes at its confluence with the Đetinja ) , and thus , of the Great Morava .\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Moravica river\", \"scope\": \"length\", \"claim\": \"The length of the Moravica river is 98 km.\", \"answer\": \"98 km\", \"quote\": \"Дуга је 98 km .\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"98 km\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"98 km\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
      }
